  "rationale": "After sorting starts, only the opposite endpoint remains to rank. Process identical records together so they contain one another without counting themselves. Rank compression replaces each distinct endpoint with its sorted position; a Fenwick tree stores running counts of these ranks and answers prefix-count queries efficiently.",
